hazf (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of HAZF v1.0.
    - Independent binary format with magic HAZF
    - Little-endian, Zstandard, CRC32
    - Commands: create, list, extract, test, info
    - Limits: 8 GiB per file, 1M entries

